_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 11
---
order: 11
---
short_label: VII.11
---
statement: If a whole is to a whole as a subtracted number is to a subtracted number, then the remainder is to the remainder as the whole is to the whole.
---
proof:

Let the whole *AB* be to the whole *CD* as *AE* subtracted is to *CF* subtracted.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="100" height="210" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="VII.11 diagram" src="propVII11.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
        canvasid: "canvas_0",
        background: "35,19,100",
        elements: [
            "A0;point;free;30,-1000;0;0",
            "A3;point;free;30,1000;0;0",
            "A;point;lineSlider;A0,A3,30,30",
            "C0;point;free;60,-1000;0;0",
            "C3;point;free;60,1000;0;0",
            "C;point;lineSlider;C0,C3,60,30",
            "B;point;lineSlider;A0,A3,30,150",
            "AB;line;connect;A,B",
            "D;point;lineSlider;C0,C3,60,180",
            "CD;line;connect;C,D",
            "E;point;lineSlider;A,B,30,80",
            "F;point;proportion;A,B,A,E,C,D,C,D"
        ],
    });
</script>
</figure>

I say that the remainder *EB* is to the remainder *FD* as the whole *AB* is to the whole *CD.*

Since *AB* is to *CD* as *AE* is to *CF,* therefore *AE* is the same part or parts of *CF* as *AB* is of *CD.* Therefore the remainder *EB* is the same part or parts of *FD* that *AB* is of *CD.* [!just VII.Def.20; VII.7, VII.8]

Therefore *EB* is to *FD* as *AB* is to *CD.* [!just VII.Def.20]

Therefore, *if a whole is to a whole as a subtracted number is to a subtracted number, then the remainder is to the remainder as the whole is to the whole.*

<div class="qed">Q.E.D.</div>
<br clear="all">
---
body:

This proposition is the numerical analogue of proposition @V.19 for general magnitudes. Symbolically,

<center>if <i>a</i> : <i>c</i> = <i>e</i> : <i>f,</i> then <i>a – e</i> : <i>c – f</i> = <i>a</i> : <i>c.</i></center>

This proposition is used in @IX.35.
